# Client-confidential material.
#
# This repo is public and git history is permanent: a confidential file
# committed once stays recoverable from history even after a later commit
# deletes it. Full client reports (the Fuel iX Fortify UX audit and market
# analysis) are shared on request by email and must not live in this repo at
# all — this is a backstop in case a working copy is ever dropped in here.
reports/
*-confidential.*
*-internal.*

# Credentials
.env
.env.*

# OS noise
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
